.el .ds Aq '
.TH tensor-wasm 1  "tensor-wasm "
.SH NAME
tensor\-wasm \- Developer CLI for Craton TensorWasm
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtensor\-wasm\fR [\fB\-\-tenant\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run, deploy, invoke, bench, snapshot, and inspect TensorWasm Wasm workloads.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tenant\fR=\fITENANT\fR [default: 0]
Tenant id to advertise on outbound API requests via X\-TensorWasm\-Tenant. Zero (the default) suppresses the header for backwards compatibility.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-run(1)
Run a Wasm module locally against the in\-process TensorWasm engine
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-deploy(1)
Upload a Wasm module to a TensorWasm server
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-invoke(1)
Invoke a previously deployed function by id
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-bench(1)
Benchmark local invocation latency (P50/P95/P99/max)
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-snapshot(1)
Save or restore an instance snapshot
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-metrics(1)
Fetch and pretty\-print Prometheus metrics from a TensorWasm server
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-observe(1)
Live operator dashboard over /healthz + /metrics (refreshes in place)
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-completions(1)
Emit shell completion scripts for the named shell
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-man(1)
Generate roff(7) man pages from the clap command tree
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBTENSOR_WASM_TOKEN\fR
If set, sent as \fBAuthorization: Bearer <token>\fR on every outbound API request.
.TP
\fBTENSOR_WASM_LOG\fR
\fBtracing-subscriber\fR EnvFilter directive. Defaults to \fBwarn\fR.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success.
.TP
1
Generic failure (network error, validation, etc.).
.TP
2
Local validation failed (snapshot subcommand only).
.TP
3
Feature requested by the CLI is not yet exposed by the server (snapshot subcommand only).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tensor\-wasm\-run(1), tensor\-wasm\-deploy(1), tensor\-wasm\-invoke(1), tensor\-wasm\-bench(1), tensor\-wasm\-snapshot(1), tensor\-wasm\-metrics(1), tensor\-wasm\-observe(1), tensor\-wasm\-completions(1), tensor\-wasm\-man(1)
